            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="step-1-create-a-new-react-app">Step 1: Create a new react app<a href="https://www.terencekong.net/blog/cypress-visual-testing-introduction#step-1-create-a-new-react-app" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Step 1: Create a new react app" title="Direct link to Step 1: Create a new react app" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">npx create-react-app demo-cypress --template typescript</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">yarn create react-app demo-cypress --template typescript</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="change-directory">Change directory<a href="https://www.terencekong.net/blog/cypress-visual-testing-introduction#change-directory" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Change directory" title="Direct link to Change directory" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">cd demo-cypress</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="current directory" src="https://www.terencekong.net/assets/images/initialProject-d2d1442192bd3652b6c95f51aa79dd7f.png" width="286" height="370" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="step-2-install-cypress-related-modules">Step 2: Install cypress related modules<a href="https://www.terencekong.net/blog/cypress-visual-testing-introduction#step-2-install-cypress-related-modules" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Step 2: Install cypress related modules" title="Direct link to Step 2: Install cypress related modules" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">npm install cypress @cypress/react --save-dev</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">yarn add -D cypress @cypress/react</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<ul>
<li>tested with <code>"@cypress/react": "^6.0.0", "cypress": "^10.4.0"</code></li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="step-3-open-cypress">Step 3: Open Cypress<a href="https://www.terencekong.net/blog/cypress-visual-testing-introduction#step-3-open-cypress" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Step 3: Open Cypress" title="Direct link to Step 3: Open Cypress" translate="no">​</a></h2>
